================================================================================
Third-Party Rule Sets & Data Attribution
================================================================================

ProxyMatrix defines domain and IP routing rules compiled independently for compatibility
with community configuration conventions established across the proxy ecosystem:

1. Loyalsoldier / clash-rules & v2ray-rules-dat
   - Repository: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/clash-rules
   - Repository: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat
   - License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
   - Scope & License Compatibility:
     * ProxyMatrix does NOT include, copy, modify, or distribute any copyrighted code,
       compiled binary databases (.dat, .mmdb), or proprietary lists from Loyalsoldier.
     * All entries in rules/rules.json are public second-level web domains or generic
       kernel syntax references (e.g. `GEOSITE,cn,DIRECT`, `GEOIP,private,DIRECT`).
     * GEOSITE/GEOIP tags are standard protocol keywords interpreted exclusively by the
       end-user's local Mihomo/Clash kernel at runtime.
     * Consequently, ProxyMatrix is an independent MIT work and not a derivative work of Loyalsoldier.

2. Community Rule Conventions (blackmatrix7 / ACL4SSR)
   - Compatibility: General domain categorization conventions for AI services, streaming media,
     and domestic bypassing. All rule entries in this repository are independently compiled domain strings.

4. MetaCubeX / Mihomo
   - Repository: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo
   - License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
   - Usage: Target configuration syntax and kernel runtime compatibility standards.
